# Context Session Economy

Cross-cutting. Referenced from workflows at **session start** and **FINISH**. Layer 0 base: @.cursor/rules/token-economy-core.mdc

## 1. Session unit

**One chat = one atomic subtask** with clear AC (not necessarily whole T-xxx).

| Scope example | Own chat? |
|---------------|-----------|
| `hold.py` only | yes |
| handler wire after handoff | yes (new chat) |
| L1 typo fix, <5 tool calls | same chat OK |
| IMPLEMENT → QA | **new chat** |
| PLAN → first IMPLEMENT step | **new chat** |

## 2. New chat — REQUIRED recommend to user

Recommend **new chat** at FINISH when **any** is true:

- Atomic subtask AC met (tests pass / QA scope done)
- Next substep differs (e.g. hold → handler)
- Role switch: IMPLEMENT/TASK/BUGFIX → QA; QA pass → REFLECT; PLAN → IMPLEMENT
- Long debug trace or many failed runs in current chat
- User reports confusion / agent repeats settled decisions

**Do NOT** require new chat for: single checkbox in same subtask; continuing debug of same bug in fresh context.

## 3. Session start (any role command)

0. **Tool routing:** if unclear — Cursor + fast-editing (default) | Claude Code + premium-coding (E2E / multi-file / **PLAN**)
1. Read `memory-bank/activeContext.md` → **`load_now` only** (default IMPLEMENT/TASK)
2. Read **§Handoff** в `activeContext.md` (единственный канон навигации)
3. **Do NOT** rely on prior chat transcript — files are source of truth
4. ONE task shard + ONE plan/domain shard (shard file, not index monolith) — **except PLAN workflows** (inventory per `workflow-*-plan.mdc`)
5. `load_if_needed` only when AC requires it
6. Prefer `memory-bank/back/code-map.md` (if exists) + `grep` before broad codebase search
7. Skills: load **only** skills needed for this subtask (not full workflow list)

### 3a. PLAN sessions — Load ≠ Write

- Lean rules in this file control **context load** and **chat brevity**, not plan file size
- Writing `plan-*.md` / `gap-*.md` → @.cursor/rules/token-economy-core.mdc §0.0 — **unlimited, exhaustive**
- Forbidden: truncate plan because «token economy» / «telegraph» / «200 lines»
- After OK PLAN: announce `SUSPENSION GUARD active — plan output unlimited`

## 4. During session

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Read once | One Read per file per session; batch edits |
| Subagent | Parent **MAY** Task/explore for wide search / multi-file / review; parent gets paths + summary only. Skip only trivial (1 file / простой grep) |
| Index | Forbidden as content load — link to ONE shard |
| Section | If focus names `§3c` — load that section only when shard is large |
| Isolation | Match level from task (L2 substep → Level2 rules, not Level4) |

## 5. FINISH — handoff block (mandatory)

Before doc-router: `## Handoff` в `activeContext.md` + append `tasks/log/YYYY-MM.md` — канон @.cursor/templates/finish-doc-router.md §Handoff / §Delivery log (idea → @.cursor/templates/idea-pipeline.md).  
Затем @.cursor/rules/shared/finish-doc-router.mdc.

## 6. User message — new chat template (RU)

Когда **New chat: yes** — текст из @.cursor/templates/finish-doc-router.md §«Сообщение пользователю» (подставить команду и пути).

## 7. QA lean load

BACK/FRONT QA scoped to one feature:

- `activeContext.md` (load_now)
- ONE task shard (AC)
- `git diff` / changed files
- grep integration §0.11
- **Skip** full plan shard unless AC ambiguous
- **Skip** explore/task «найти scope» — parent сам гоняет `.venv/bin/pytest` / smoke из handoff
- **FORBIDDEN:** `kilo_local_recall` / дамп прошлых Kilo sessions вместо файлов

## 8. TASK / BUGFIX

- Prefer `activeContext` + `load_now` over loading all core memory-bank roots
- Load `projectbrief` / `techContext` only if task is cross-cutting or user asks
- Wide search → parent **MAY** spawn subagent; FINISH → handoff + new chat if scope was large

## 9. Forbidden

- Loading `done — do NOT load` paths
- Duplicating plan prose into task shard or chat
- Keeping completed substep in `load_now`
- Over-refusal: never spawning when wide search/review needed
- Trivial-only skip: do not spawn for single-file read / простой grep / мелкий edit (это не запрет на wide work)
